# armour/shared/pauldron_fur2_r: the small leather shoulder pad on the right shoulder (fur.2; LADDER-ARMOUR, STYLE_P2 25.6,
# 27.2: T2's "small shoulder pads"): a boiled-leather cap 1 px past the shoulder line, matte, one step-4 shine on the lit
# top-left, no glint; `when furtrim` lays a fur edge along its rim (the Fjordfolk and Highland trim).
# Finish regions: R the rim, P the cap's face, W a spot on the shadow side. Shared by both bodies. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron fur.2
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
z 5
side R

